    "detailed_description": "Friend or Foe is a first person, survival, open world craft game with a story to tell and a world to explore.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the island</h2><br>You find yourself stranded alone after falling asleep in your boat. The only way home is to explore the vast forest, in search for anything that can tell you where you are, and how you can get home. Along the way, you find yourself facing the animals that inhabits this island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose a path</h2><br>Every decision counts. Will you be the one who protects the animals or hunt them? Are you the friend or the foe?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build and Survive</h2><br>Even though the first priority is to find a way home, there is always a need to find shelther once the evening comes. Cut down trees and gather other resources to build yourself a shelther, or perhaps even a second home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mystery</h2><br>Where did you end up? How will you get home?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Development Team</h2><br>Friend or Foe is created by a single developer, who is located in Norway. This is also the first game that the developer has ever released.",
